    "independentOfHostActivity": true,
    "note": "Controller workflow state and host activity are independent axes. An idle host while waiting_children renders as 'Waiting on N children - host idle', never as completed. The controller has exactly one terminal workflow state; whether the run completed, failed or was cancelled is carried by the authoritative run.outcome, never inferred from the controller lane.",
