    "note": "Host activity is a liveness axis only. `unknown` is the honest pre-observation value and is never rendered as idle or complete. Finer host detail (thinking, running a named tool, awaiting permission, awaiting user) is carried in the accompanying detail string rather than by inventing extra axis values, so the axis stays comparable across skills.",
